---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="RI Masterclass - Computer Science at London MET University" description="RI Masterclass - Computer Science at London MET University - readysaltedcode story">
  <section class="page-header">
    <div class="container">
      <nav class="breadcrumb">
        <a href="/stories">Stories</a>
      </nav>
      <h1>RI Masterclass - Computer Science at London MET University</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <article class="story-content">
    <div class="container">
      <p>RI Masterclass at London MET University<br />
      <p>This is what the Royal Institution of Great Britain have to say about their programme.<br />
      <p>We delivered a Masterclass on Computer Science, showing the students what the subject means to readysaltedcode and our STEAM approach to learning. We had an in-depth look at the code and data visualisations used in [data]Storm. They all loved the Protocols and Virus dataviz and who wouldn’t love the fantastic work by animateddata.<br />
      <p><iframe width="680" height="383" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/uNYhZ_ojXEE?feature=oembed" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen></iframe></p>
      <p>Then the fun with crumble. We had great fun using Redfern Electronics' Crumble Board to light up single sparkles to LED strips and LED rings. If only we had more time. </p>
      <p>A super fun day</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-header {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a2e 0%, #16213e 100%);
    color: #fff;
    padding: 3rem 0;
  }
  .breadcrumb { margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .breadcrumb a { color: #ccc; }
  .page-header h1 { color: #fff; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .story-content { padding: 3rem 0; }
  .story-content .container { max-width: 800px; }
  .story-content p { margin-bottom: 1.5rem; line-height: 1.8; }
  .story-content img { max-width: 100%; height: auto; margin: 1.5rem 0; border-radius: 8px; }
  .story-content a { color: #dd3333; }
  .story-content blockquote { border-left: 4px solid #dd3333; padding-left: 1.5rem; margin: 1.5rem 0; font-style: italic; color: #555; }
  .story-content strong { font-weight: 600; }
</style>
